# Individual-level inputs that may not be published.
#
# These files are NOT in this repository. ED1A, ED3D and ED3E tell a reader with
# an approved MoTrPAC consortium data-access request to put a local copy where
# the panel looks for it; these rules keep that copy from being committed.
#
# Matched on FILENAME, not on an exact path. The exact-path form silently
# stopped matching when the figure folders were reorganised, which is the
# failure this is written to avoid: a bare name matches at any depth, so it
# holds wherever a reader puts the file and whatever the folders are called.
1kg.motrpac.merged.maf_0_05.ld_pruned.pca.RDS
CIBERSORTx_PrecovidBlood_RNADecon_Results_081226.csv
motrpac_human-precovid_1kg_pca.csv
